<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 56px', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Noto Sans SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>三系统协同架构与运行启动</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        业务数据层 × 诊断分析层 × 知识智能层：从质量记录到机理结论再到经验复用
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 3, paddingTop: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>ARCHITECTURE</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>AND RUNTIME</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />

  <Box style={{ height: 510, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 740, height: 510, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

      <Box style={{ height: 128, background: '#F0FDFA', border: '1px solid #99F6E4', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 15, background: '#0D9488', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>业务数据层 · BOPET 企业质量数据平台</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#0F766E', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>Nuxt 3 · Prisma · SQLite/PG · ECharts</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          质量数据与客诉问题全流程管理：记录新建 / 编辑 / 导入 / 导出、五维主数据（产线 · 客户 · 型号 · 责任部门 · 责任工序）、多维统计分析与表单模板引擎
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 10 }} />

      <Box style={{ height: 128, background: '#EFF6FF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 15, background: '#2563EB', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>诊断分析层 · 工业深度诊断引擎 IDD</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#1D4ED8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>Express · 14 Harness · 14 Agents × 18 Skills</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          Step 0-10 可审计根因分析管线：本体与 RAG 深度理解、统计 + VLM 视觉分析、竞争性假设诊断；CP-1~9 质量门禁、证据分级 L1-L7、反假相关校验（时滞 CCF / 辛普森 / 留一杠杆）
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 10 }} />

      <Box style={{ height: 128, background: '#F5F3FF', border: '1px solid #DDD6FE', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 15, background: '#7C3AED', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>知识智能层 · RAG Knowledge 知识平台</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#6D28D9', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>Python 3.12 · ChromaDB · Neo4j · MinerU</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          企业级文档智能与智能体知识库：QDCVR 内容验证检索（0-8 评分，低于 4 硬丢弃）、BM25 + 向量多路召回、Neo4j 知识图谱、E0-E12 经验生命周期、94 个 MCP 工具与 19 个 Agent Skills、SOUL 人格系统
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F1F5F9', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>DATA FLOW</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.6, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
          质量记录 → 时序数据上传 → 深度诊断 → 机理结论 → 知识沉淀与复用
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          BOPET 产生业务数据，IDD 输出可审计根因，RAG Knowledge 让结论成为可检索、可复用的企业经验
        </Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 150, background: '#0B1220', border: '1px solid #1E293B', borderRadius: 10, padding: 5 }}>
        <Image src="assets/term_startup.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6 }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />

      <Box style={{ height: 140, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 108, height: 140, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 8, padding: 3 }}>
          <Image src="assets/login_card.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>统一鉴权入口</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
            注册 / 登录签发会话，或创建 API Token 供程序化调用；全部 API 端点拦截校验，未携带凭据返回 401。
          </Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            Bearer JWT 24h · Token 仅存 SHA-256
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 14px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>运行中服务与启动方式</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              <span style={{ color: '#0D9488', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>BOPET EDA</span> · 3100 / 3001
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>npm run dev:init</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              <span style={{ color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>IDD 诊断引擎</span> · 3210 / 5180 / 8764
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>ind-diag all</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              <span style={{ color: '#7C3AED', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>RAG Knowledge</span> · 8770 · 8771 / 6789
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>start.bat · ragctl</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', height: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#94A3B8' }}>BOPET EDA · IDD 诊断引擎 · RAG Knowledge 知识平台</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>01 / 02</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
